doc "aemwspd2tjdsp4qqn2tjqndvanwqkr4td4d5q7hxffnkeljo6b2qmg7" "What the system records of a file: its kind, and who else may reach it."
item "platform::os::Metadata.accessible_by_others"
text "pub fn Metadata.accessible_by_others(self, user: u32) -> bool"
interface "ahrwzvhnl5lyoqvth3vbjkdgtyosgwn2huanny5ts5ntypnoqoj3cr5"
digest aarch64-linux "effects none | authority none | may-trap no | terminates"
digest aarch64-macos "effects none | authority none | may-trap no | terminates"
digest aarch64-nanos "effects none | authority none | may-trap no | terminates"
digest aarch64-windows "effects none | authority none | may-trap no | terminates"
digest x86_64-linux "effects none | authority none | may-trap no | terminates"
digest x86_64-macos "effects none | authority none | may-trap no | terminates"
digest x86_64-nanos "effects none | authority none | may-trap no | terminates"
digest x86_64-windows "effects none | authority none | may-trap no | terminates"
doc "ahrwzvhnl5lyoqvth3vbjkdgtyosgwn2huanny5ts5ntypnoqoj3cr5" "Whether a user other than `user` owns the file or may access it, as its owner and mode say on\nLinux and macOS; never on Windows, whose access control lists the toolchain does not read, nor\non NaN OS, whose files have no owner."
